<title>HONG KONG: Kwoon Chung increases stake on Shanghai bus firm.</title>
<headline>Kwoon Chung increases stake on Shanghai bus firm.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kwoon Chung Bus Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it had increased its stake in Shanghai Pudong Kwoon Chung Public Transport Co Ltd of Shanghai, China, to 51.5 percent from 46.5 percent.</p>
<p>The Hong Kong-based bus company said in a statement the increase transformed Shanghai Kwoon Chung from an associated company into a subsidiary company.</p>
<p>It said the majority share would enable the group to implement its strategic policies in the region.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
